							? `Input: Procedural vector canvas (24-frame window, 0 KB network download) → Transcoded output: ${displaySize} (${bitrateMbps} Mbps bitstream at 24 fps). Uncompressed 24-frame YUV 4:2:0 raster in RAM: ${rawMb} MB.`
